{"unit_id":"Zian-anson__dsh-prompt-seed#card-zh","repo":"Zian-anson/dsh-prompt-seed","commit":"104948860daeb0c2bb7e015e2facc51d9c9ddb61","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-seed 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的编辑器插件，在输入栏提供草稿改写与下一句预测。它通过模型流式生成，把改写结果或候选回复显示在草稿操作面板中。主要功能包括补全简短提示词、整理口述草稿、结合近期对话预测用户回复，以及预览或恢复草稿。适合希望在发送前完善表达或快速起草回复的 DSH 用户。调用使用 DSH 当前模型配置，可选择提供商与模型；需要 DSH 网页客户端及 Host。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-plugin.js:298-322","src/optimize.js:38-140","src/predict.js:16-76"]}
{"unit_id":"Zian-anson__dsh-prompt-seed#card-en","repo":"Zian-anson/dsh-prompt-seed","commit":"104948860daeb0c2bb7e015e2facc51d9c9ddb61","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-seed adds draft rewriting and next-reply prediction to the DSH web composer. It can expand short prompts, tighten spoken drafts, use recent conversation to suggest a reply, and preview or restore text. Model calls use the Host selection; provider and model overrides are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-plugin.js:298-322","src/optimize.js:38-140","src/predict.js:16-76"]}
