{"unit_id":"Zian-anson__dsh-prompt-seed#feature-rewrite","repo":"Zian-anson/dsh-prompt-seed","commit":"104948860daeb0c2bb7e015e2facc51d9c9ddb61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-seed 的功能「草稿改写」：优化编辑器中的提示词，补足必要细节并保留原意。点击改写后流式生成结果，可查看并替换草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/optimize.js:38-70","src/optimize.js:130-140"]}
{"unit_id":"Zian-anson__dsh-prompt-seed#feature-predict","repo":"Zian-anson/dsh-prompt-seed","commit":"104948860daeb0c2bb7e015e2facc51d9c9ddb61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-seed 的功能「下一句预测」：依据最近对话和用户表达生成一个可能的用户回复。编辑器为空且有足够对话时点击水晶球，候选文本可预览后放入草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/predict.js:16-24","src/predict.js:40-76"]}
{"unit_id":"Zian-anson__dsh-prompt-seed#feature-context","repo":"Zian-anson/dsh-prompt-seed","commit":"104948860daeb0c2bb7e015e2facc51d9c9ddb61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-seed 的功能「近期上下文」：改写短草稿或含指代的文本时读取最近用户与助手消息，帮助解析上下文中的引用。上下文缺失时仍可继续改写。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/context.js:31-60","src/context.js:68-80"]}
{"unit_id":"Zian-anson__dsh-prompt-seed#feature-recovery","repo":"Zian-anson/dsh-prompt-seed","commit":"104948860daeb0c2bb7e015e2facc51d9c9ddb61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-seed 的功能「草稿结果恢复」：按会话保存改写和预测任务状态；结果不能安全自动写入时可先预览，再明确替换草稿，也可恢复改写前的原文。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-plugin.js:130-180","src/jobs.js:300-354"]}
{"unit_id":"Zian-anson__dsh-prompt-seed#feature-stream","repo":"Zian-anson/dsh-prompt-seed","commit":"104948860daeb0c2bb7e015e2facc51d9c9ddb61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-seed 的功能「流式生成」：改写和预测都通过 DSH 模型流逐段接收文本，完成后给出结果或明确的失败状态。每轮生成执行一次模型调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/optimize.js:88-140","src/predict.js:48-76"]}
